{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/e154cb1be9b4c160ccee4482d0b23d6c.avif?t=1762575981\" width=1560 height=468 /></span><strong>EXPERIENCE A BREATHTAKING TECHNO-FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ETRE</strong> is a <strong>3D Metroidvania</strong> adventure set in a luminous TECHNO-FANTASY world, blending layered EXPLORATION, deep STORYTELLING, COMBAT and environmental PUZZLES.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the one chosen by the ETRE to chart a massive living <strong>LABYRINTH</strong>. Use the power of your <strong>MIND</strong> to traverse vast spatial structures, combat and investigate strange machines, and immerse yourself in a story of emergence of a NEW WORLD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/7bd03b3a66572874f12b220cacfdb4cc.poster.avif?t=1762575981\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/7bd03b3a66572874f12b220cacfdb4cc.webm?t=1762575981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/7bd03b3a66572874f12b220cacfdb4cc.mp4?t=1762575981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>FLUID COMBAT</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>On Foot and Aerial</i></strong> <br>Move with intent: every encounter is a choice.<br>Advance on foot, measured and precise, or rise into the air where speed meets danger.<br>The machines you face can be destroyed, subdued, or transformed into allies, <br>each unlocking new ways to navigate the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/057c7a80e8579227102b2f6b0c0cf128.poster.avif?t=1762575981\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/057c7a80e8579227102b2f6b0c0cf128.webm?t=1762575981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/057c7a80e8579227102b2f6b0c0cf128.mp4?t=1762575981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>BOSS ENCOUNTERS</u>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Living Geometry</strong><br><br>Confront the Living Geometry,\u00a0celestial guardians gone rogue.<br>Each encounter is both duel and riddle, blurring the line between combat and comprehension.<br>To prevail, you must think as much as fight: precision and insight are your true weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>MIND TETHER</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Duality of Body and Mind</i> <br> <br>Leave your body to soar through spaces freely,overcome barriers, and engage in dynamic aerial combat. <br>But tread carefully, your mind can only wander so far before the tether pulls you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Extend your Mind Tether, unlock new paths and return to familiar places with newfound power and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/0e0516cef1a53d9767680f5bfde8bad9.poster.avif?t=1762575981\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/0e0516cef1a53d9767680f5bfde8bad9.webm?t=1762575981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/0e0516cef1a53d9767680f5bfde8bad9.mp4?t=1762575981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>DISCOVERY &amp; EXPLORATION</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Traverse interconnected world filled with hidden pathways, grand halls, and advanced yet enigmatic machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your scanning abilities to detect glyphs, decode what was forgotten, and piece together a truth buried in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2391940?t=1762575981","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/bea7eb643ea0fc6917eef6171ddf00eb299a0430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762575981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/b2808a0baba38fe24638c40c0a6c06a878e88f3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762575981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/b2808a0baba38fe24638c40c0a6c06a878e88f3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762575981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391940/extras/e154cb1be9b4c160ccee4482d0b23d6c.avif?t=1762575981\" width=1560 height=468 /></span><strong>EXPERIENCE A BREATHTAKING TECHNO-FA